  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Pontike</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "The province of Pontus became Diospontus in the Diocese of Pontus by 314. Following the death of Helena, mother of Constantine I, in 328 it was renamed Helenopontos. In 535/6 it was joined with Pontus Polemoniacus but retained the name Helenopontos.",
